{"hunks": [{"lines": [{"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 1, "text": "<div id=\"category_tab\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 2, "text": "\t<p class=\"tit\">CHANGE UNIVERSE :</p>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 3, "text": "\t<ul class=\"c_tab\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 4, "text": "\t\t<li><a class=\"selected\" href=\"#dior_subtab1\">女香</a></li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 5, "text": "\t\t<li><a href=\"#dior_subtab2\">男香</a></li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 6, "text": "\t\t<li><a href=\"#dior_subtab3\">彩妆</a></li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 7, "text": "\t\t<li><a href=\"#dior_subtab4\">护肤</a></li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 8, "text": "\t</ul>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 9, "text": "\t<ul class=\"panel\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 10, "text": "\t\t<li id=\"dior_subtab1\" style=\"display: list-item;\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 11, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"p_sec01\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 12, "text": "\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.lottedfs.com/contents/images/ckeditor-img/20261019/202610191556316229bd532723f4a4f8fb5504435c1d7b6f4.webp\" style=\"width: 762px; height: 332px;\"><br>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 13, "text": "\t\t\t\t迪奥小姐香水，以蜜意玫瑰、绵柔香草与檀木香息，演绎木质西普调。", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 14, "text": "\t\t\t</div>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 15, "text": "\t\t</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 16, "text": "\t\t<li id=\"dior_subtab2\" style=\"display: none;\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 17, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"p_sec01\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 18, "text": "\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.lottedfs.com/contents/images/ckeditor-img/20261019/20261019155720243dda40febd597472190b710adbf704706.webp\" style=\"width: 762px; height: 332px;\"><br>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 19, "text": "\t\t\t\t迪奥旷野系列首款男士浓香精，木质香调演绎，香气格外馥郁浓醇。", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 20, "text": "\t\t\t</div>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 21, "text": "\t\t</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 22, "text": "\t\t<li id=\"dior_subtab3\" style=\"display: none;\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 23, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"p_sec01\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 24, "text": "\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.lottedfs.com/contents/images/ckeditor-img/20261019/20261019155702771d9f82ef4497540579913bbfc45cde04a.webp\" style=\"width: 762px; height: 332px;\"><br>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 25, "text": "\t\t\t\t快来看看迪奥全新哑光色彩的液体口红，以及迷人的持久口红全新哑光妆效。", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 26, "text": "\t\t\t</div>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 27, "text": "\t\t</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 28, "text": "\t\t<li id=\"dior_subtab4\" style=\"display: none;\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 29, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"p_sec01\">", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 30, "text": "\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.lottedfs.com/contents/images/ckeditor-img/20260928/202609280921597651ce2248bd2c743f68bbc56f34d78bb48.webp\" style=\"width: 762px; height: 332px;\"><br>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 31, "text": "\t\t\t\t循迹玫瑰致美光华，开启花秘奢护仪式。每日早晚涂抹迪奥花秘瑰萃乳霜，见证肌肤奢焕年轻。", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 32, "text": "\t\t\t</div>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 33, "text": "\t\t</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 34, "text": "\t</ul>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 35, "text": "</div>", "spans": []}]}], "added": 35, "removed": 0, "same": false, "places": ["탭 안쪽"], "normalized": false}